---
// Root URL redirect. Astro i18n requires this file to exist when
// prefixDefaultLocale: true is set; its only job is to send / to the
// default-locale route /en/ (see docs/i18n-plan.md, Phase 0).
//
// A static meta-refresh page is used instead of `redirectToDefaultLocale`
// because the built-in i18n redirect route then conflicts with this required
// file during prerender (PrerenderRouteConflict) — and this page works on
// every static host without an adapter.
---
<!doctype html>
<title>Redirecting to: /en/</title>
<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/en/">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="canonical" href="/en/">
<body>
	<a href="/en/">Redirecting from <code>/</code> to <code>/en/</code></a>
</body>
